    <div class="op-faq__list" data-reveal>
      <article class="op-faq-item is-open"><button class="op-faq-item__question" type="button" aria-expanded="true"><span>01</span><strong>How much does digital marketing cost in Dubai and the UAE?</strong><i aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="op-faq-item__answer"><div><p>Digital marketing costs in the UAE typically range from <b>AED 3,000 to AED 30,000+ per month</b>, depending on services, channels, competition and business size. SEO retainers generally start from AED 3,500 per month, while Google Ads management starts from AED 2,000 per month, separate from ad spend. Optimizers creates custom proposals after understanding your goals and budget.</p></div></div></article>
      <article class="op-faq-item"><button class="op-faq-item__question" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>02</span><strong>How long does SEO take to show results in the UAE?</strong><i aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="op-faq-item__answer"><div><p>Most UAE businesses see measurable SEO improvements within <b>3 to 4 months</b> for local and medium-competition keywords. Highly competitive searches generally require 6 to 12 months of consistent work. SEO results compound over time and can continue generating traffic after monthly investment is reduced.</p></div></div></article>
      <article class="op-faq-item"><button class="op-faq-item__question" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>03</span><strong>Which digital marketing channel works best for UAE businesses?</strong><i aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="op-faq-item__answer"><div><p>The right channel depends on your business, goals and buyer behavior. Google Ads gives immediate visibility, SEO builds long-term organic traffic, WhatsApp supports direct communication, and Instagram or TikTok suit visual consumer brands. Consistently growing businesses usually combine at least two channels.</p></div></div></article>
      <article class="op-faq-item"><button class="op-faq-item__question" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>04</span><strong>Do Optimizers work with businesses outside of Dubai?</strong><i aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="op-faq-item__answer"><div><p>Yes. We serve businesses across all seven UAE emirates and support UAE companies running cross-border campaigns across GCC countries, the wider Middle East and international markets.</p></div></div></article>
      <article class="op-faq-item"><button class="op-faq-item__question" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>05</span><strong>What makes Optimizers different from other digital marketing agencies in the UAE?</strong><i aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="op-faq-item__answer"><div><p>Our partnership credentials, consultancy-led approach, and decisions based on real UAE market data set us apart. We explain the strategy before execution, and pricing is built around your goals rather than forcing every business into the same fixed package.</p></div></div></article>
      <article class="op-faq-item"><button class="op-faq-item__question" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>06</span><strong>Can Optimizers manage both SEO and Google Ads at the same time?</strong><i aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="op-faq-item__answer"><div><p>Yes. Google Ads provides immediate visibility while SEO builds organic authority. Our paid and SEO teams share keyword, landing-page and conversion insights, treating both channels as one unified growth system.</p></div></div></article>
      <article class="op-faq-item"><button class="op-faq-item__question" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>07</span><strong>Do you offer digital marketing services in Arabic?</strong><i aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="op-faq-item__answer"><div><p>Yes. Our team creates campaign copy, content and SEO material in Arabic and English, helping businesses reach Arabic-speaking UAE residents and customers across the wider Gulf region.</p></div></div></article>
